List of parallel FIRKODE examples

  firk_robertson_batched_p : batched Robertson kinetics on NVECTOR_PARALLEL,
                             SPGMR with a block-Jacobi preconditioner; the run
                             checks itself against a serial run on rank 0

Sample results:

  The example prints the solution of the first copy, the step and Newton
  iteration counts of the distributed and serial runs, and PASSED or FAILED.
  Iteration counts may differ across platforms.
